## Components

Build exactly these components:

App.jsx
- Holds all state: activeChat, chats list, messages per chat
- Renders Sidebar + ChatWindow side by side
- On mobile: renders only one at a time based on activeChat

Sidebar.jsx
- Receives: chats, activeChat, onSelectChat, searchQuery, onSearchChange
- Renders header + search + scrollable ChatListItem list

ChatListItem.jsx  
- Receives: chat object, isActive, onClick
- Renders one row: avatar, name, preview, timestamp, badge

ChatWindow.jsx
- Receives: chat, messages, onSendMessage, onBack (mobile)
- Renders ChatHeader + MessageList + MessageInput

ChatHeader.jsx
- Receives: contact name, avatar, status, onBack
- Renders the top bar

MessageList.jsx
- Receives: messages array
- Groups messages by date and by sender
- Renders DateDivider + MessageBubble list
- Auto-scrolls to bottom on new message

MessageBubble.jsx
- Receives: message, isSent, showAvatar, isLastInGroup
- Renders the bubble with correct style, timestamp, read receipt

DateDivider.jsx
- Receives: label string ("Today", "Yesterday", date string)
- Renders centered date pill

MessageInput.jsx
- Receives: onSend callback
- Manages its own input state
- Renders emoji + attachment + input + send/mic button

